ce (finish hook owns it), still fires for a LIVE source.\n\n**Wave 2 â€” Grass: always proceed + open the session (UI) â€” GREEN 1260 (2 iters)**\n- Removed the `no-research-material` hard-refusal in `effort_history.advance_grass_research_to_plan` â†’ it falls through to the v10 W5 contained-grass mint/focus/link machinery with the W1 transcript-backed (or honest-minimal) prompt; kept the `no-research-session` negative.\n- **Review found a blocker (ordering bug):** develop-plan-first + conversation-only â€” the transcript was committed to main HEAD and named in the prompt, but the pre-existing plan worktree was cut BEFORE the commit, so the file was absent from its checkout (silent broken handoff).\n- **FIX:** new `_materialize_handoff_into_plan_worktree` copies the persisted transcript/doc rels into the plan dev session's worktree + writes HANDOFF.md + NEXT-PROMPT.md there (matching the non-grass path), wired into both fresh-mint and focused-existing branches; test asserts the file is on-disk (`(plan_wt/rel).is_file()`), proven to fail pre-fix.\n- **John signed off 2026-06-20** (committed `9552049`) â€” his reported grass failure is fixed.\n\n**Wave 3 â€” Healthcheck v11.1 + docs (PROJECT DONE) â€” GREEN 1266**\n- `anchor_healthcheck.check_rnd_v11_1_surface` (registered in `main()`) walks the real conversation-only flow fully stubbed, with `ANCHOR_PROACTIVE_SUMMARY` off+restored in the finally: (a) researchâ†’plan seeds the stub PTY buffer (NO file/record_effort/kill), asserts the transcript is snapshotted+persisted+committed, prompt names `research/<sid>-transcript.md`, idempotent; (b) grass advance opens + materializes the transcript on disk in the plan worktree + contained + linked.\n- Closeout review: GO â€” genuinely walks the flow (zero `record_effort`, asserts on-disk), hermeticity sound, docs map to shipped code, distro clean.\n\n**Outcome:** All 3 waves GREEN (1266 passed, 1 skipped). The conversation-only handoff gap is fixed for both grass and non-grass: